  ("Do you offer 24 hour HVAC service in Ontario?", "EHI offers emergency HVAC repair evenings, weekends and holidays across Ontario, with same-day service in most areas. Call 1-647-694-5845 and we'll book the first available technician for your city."),
  ("What counts as an HVAC emergency?", "An HVAC emergency is no heat in freezing weather, no cooling during extreme heat for someone vulnerable, a gas smell, a carbon monoxide alarm, or water pouring from the system. Gas smell and CO alarms are safety emergencies: leave the house and call 911 first."),
